&_nc_oc=AdogSBCdHqEGR08UmS8CnsGRNR32Ygb0Un9TJl_epjICmNvPrXk0Q3dfF1-cRPziWec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBGMB4UR2DOfmEWCRSCzF5Wi-UFsl7qWy52fxW2u9lwQ&oe=6A688F7E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OxPAOx1puFAQ7kNvwEhvuY_&_nc_oc=AdoqopoQOKlZB0Ot7tU1mMepiPTYUtOXD5WqBNrvE0mUyFQ-eZrDphfltbe8INZBbnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBwhMOTHIoBgq4QYfbD3cPcIZlIh5djsynRMb-jMe9V-w&oe=6A68A07C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Ej--5gCSvcQ7kNvwEXOJy9&_nc_oc=AdpUyd_bSVI3I1xm5--wMH8Rz13Ca4-by1od8WOQafA3Zo8qzHKHk6C7rIu8fsBcjAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA99ZTbblwAkkbvO2o1At9q8QQYaqpB3NF16Eh5lEZ8vg&oe=6A68BF07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJEAXVcQswwQ7kNvwGBhMYg&_nc_oc=AdrgYVEkMGyH6soHy6tzI-PGyXzmesoSpTpNxYRjn-F8bwyALCZzg_CME4aR0i5LCG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCi7XDLwoTWumYNJ5W1XtiaFtkX04_wPZv2M9jvmdxX3g&oe=6A68AAD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUBxx9Bow0gQ7kNvwGOdLOm&_nc_oc=AdqjacrZgIAYq5BE3IMisUP4AV6g8u1k6bU4J0QjVpCMp0Lbp7X_VIS5zLSycUACwz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDB6JYCLDnLfm5ZN1OVatCafATCDl0OoIVhppvkNyifjw&oe=6A68B764"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.